B.aQm=new A.FT("Avant de commencer","THIX ID a besoin de certains acc\xe8s pour vous prot\xe9ger et vous aider efficacement.","Localisation","Pour envoyer votre position exacte \xe0 vos secours lors d'une alerte SOS et vous montrer les objets \xe0 proximit\xe9.","Cam\xe9ra","Pour photographier un objet perdu ou trouv\xe9 dans THIX RETROUVE.","Notifications","Pour vous alerter en temps r\xe9el d'une alerte SOS proche ou d'une r\xe9ponse \xe0 votre d\xe9claration.","Contacts","Pour ajouter facilement vos proches comme secours dans vos cercles de s\xe9curit\xe9.","Continuer","Plus tard","Vous pourrez modifier ces acc\xe8s \xe0 tout moment dans les r\xe9glages.")
B.eFr=new A.FT("Before you start","THIX ID needs a few permissions to protect and help you effectively.","Location","To send your exact position to your rescuers during an SOS alert and show nearby items.","Camera","To photograph a lost or found item in THIX RETROUVE.","Notifications","To alert you in real time about a nearby SOS alert or a reply to your report.","Contacts","To easily add your loved ones as rescuers in your safety circles.","Continue","Later","You can change these permissions anytime in settings.")
B.eFt=new A.FT("Antes de comenzar","THIX ID necesita algunos permisos para protegerte y ayudarte de forma eficaz.","Ubicaci\xf3n","Para enviar tu posici\xf3n exacta a tus rescatistas durante una alerta SOS y mostrarte objetos cercanos.","C\xe1mara","Para fotografiar un objeto perdido o encontrado en THIX RETROUVE.","Notificaciones","Para avisarte en tiempo real de una alerta SOS cercana o una respuesta a tu declaraci\xf3n.","Contactos","Para a\xf1adir f\xe1cilmente a tus seres queridos como rescatistas en tus c\xedrculos de seguridad.","Continuar","M\xe1s tarde","Podr\xe1s cambiar estos permisos en cualquier momento en los ajustes.")
B.eFp=new A.FT("Antes de come\xe7ar","O THIX ID precisa de algumas permiss\xf5es para proteger e ajudar voc\xea de forma eficaz.","Localiza\xe7\xe3o","Para enviar sua posi\xe7\xe3o exata aos socorristas durante um alerta SOS e mostrar objetos pr\xf3ximos.","C\xe2mera","Para fotografar um objeto perdido ou encontrado no THIX RETROUVE.","Notifica\xe7\xf5es","Para alertar voc\xea em tempo real sobre um SOS pr\xf3ximo ou uma resposta \xe0 sua declara\xe7\xe3o.","Contatos","Para adicionar facilmente seus entes queridos como socorristas nos seus c\xedrculos de seguran\xe7a.","Continuar","Mais tarde","Voc\xea pode alterar essas permiss\xf5es a qualquer momento nas configura\xe7\xf5es.")
B.eFq=new A.FT("Kabla ya kuanza","THIX ID inahitaji ruhusa fulani ili kukulinda na kukusaidia kwa ufanisi.","Mahali","Ili kutuma eneo lako kamili kwa waokoaji wako wakati wa tahadhari ya SOS na kukuonyesha vitu vilivyo karibu.","Kamera","Ili kupiga picha ya kitu kilichopotea au kupatikana kwenye THIX RETROUVE.","Arifa","Ili kukujulisha papo hapo kuhusu tahadhari ya SOS iliyo karibu au jibu la taarifa yako.","Anwani","Ili kuongeza kwa urahisi wapendwa wako kama waokoaji katika duru zako za usalama.","Endelea","Baadaye","Unaweza kubadilisha ruhusa hizi wakati wowote kwenye mipangilio.")
B.eFo=new A.FT("\u0642\u0628\u0644 \u0623\u0646 \u062a\u0628\u062f\u0623","\u064a\u062d\u062a\u0627\u062c THIX ID \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0628\u0639\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0630\u0648\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0644\u062d\u0645\u0627\u064a\u062a\u0643 \u0648\u0645\u0633\u0627\u0639\u062f\u062a\u0643 \u0628\u0641\u0639\u0627\u0644\u064a\u0629.","\u0627\u0644\u0645\u0648\u0642\u0639","\u0644\u0625\u0631\u0633\u0627\u0644 \u0645\u0648\u0642\u0639\u0643 \u0627\u0644\u062f\u0642\u064a\u0642 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0645\u0646\u0642\u0630\u064a\u0646 \u0623\u062b\u0646\u0627\u0621 \u062a\u0646\u0628\u064a\u0647 SOS \u0648\u0639\u0631\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u063a\u0631\u0627\u0636 \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0631\u064a\u0628\u0629 \u0645\u0646\u0643.","\u0627\u0644\u0643\u0627\u0645\u064a\u0631\u0627","\u0644\u062a\u0635\u0648\u064a\u0631 \u063a\u0631\u0636 \u0645\u0641\u0642\u0648\u062f \u0623\u0648 \u062a\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u062b\u0648\u0631 \u0639\u0644\u064a\u0647 \u0641\u064a THIX RETROUVE.","\u0627\u0644\u0625\u0634\u0639\u0627\u0631\u0627\u062a","\u0644\u062a\u0646\u0628\u064a\u0647\u0643 \u0641\u0648\u0631\u064b\u0627 \u0628\u0634\u0623\u0646 \u062a\u0646\u0628\u064a\u0647 SOS \u0642\u0631\u064a\u0628 \u0623\u0648 \u0631\u062f \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0628\u0644\u0627\u063a\u0643.","\u062c\u0647\u0627\u062a \u0627\u0644\u0627\u062a\u0635\u0627\u0644","\u0644\u0625\u0636\u0627\u0641\u0629 \u0623\u062d\u0628\u0627\u0626\u0643 \u0628\u0633\u0647\u0648\u0644\u0629 \u0643\u0645\u0646\u0642\u0630\u064a\u0646 \u0636\u0645\u0646 \u062f\u0648\u0627\u0626\u0631 \u0623\u0645\u0627\u0646\u0643.","\u0645\u062a\u0627\u0628\u0639\u0629","\u0644\u0627\u062d\u0642\u064b\u0627","\u064a\u0645\u0643\u0646\u0643 \u062a\u063a\u064a\u064a\u0631 \u0647\u0630\u0647 \u0627\u0644\u0623\u0630\u0648\u0646\u0627\u062a \u0641\u064a \u0623\u064a \u0648\u0642\u062a \u0645\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0625\u0639\u062f\u0627\u062f\u0627\u062a.")
